# DrumMania 9th Mix (System 573, digital I/O board): the first power-on from blank NVRAM, with no inputs.
# The 573 BIOS boots the runtime CD, which installs itself to the onboard flash,
# then shows INFO 508 (install done, power-cycle). Hashes the main RAM every frame and
# snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game drmn9ma

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 12000 quit
